period ended September&nbsp;30, 2013 or the period ended December&nbsp;31, 2012. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of September&nbsp;30, 2013, pursuant to the terms of
